[
    {
        "content": "<p>Is there anything in Lean similar to the HOL Light <a href=\"https://github.com/jrh13/hol-light/blob/master/Library/bitmatch.ml\">bitmatch</a>? <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"110049\">@Mario Carneiro</span> ?</p>",
        "id": 620382269,
        "sender_full_name": "Alexandre Rademaker",
        "timestamp": 1788195434
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>This has been implemented in LNSym called <code>match_bv</code>, at some point and later revived in other projects to varying degrees.</p>",
        "id": 620564222,
        "sender_full_name": "Henrik Böving",
        "timestamp": 1788248903
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Just for reference, the definition of LNSym's <code>match_bv</code> can be found <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/LNSym/blob/5c05220ff970e3bdd7813ad0c9ef3741522c8b92/Arm/BitVec.lean#L1210\">here</a>. An here is an example:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BitVec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">32</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BitVec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">16</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">match_bv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">sf</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0011010000</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"n\">Rm</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">000000</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"n\">Rn</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"n\">Rd</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">++</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Rm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">++</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Rn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">++</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Rd</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">sf</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0000010000</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">11111000000</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"n\">Rn</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"n\">Rd</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">++</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Rn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">++</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Rd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">++</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Rd</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"mi\">16</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Thanks for the pointer <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"395550\">@Henrik Böving</span> !</p>",
        "id": 620985189,
        "sender_full_name": "Guilherme Lima",
        "timestamp": 1788349839
    }
]